ve devices, and low loss cables; and ethernet, I/O, and industrial and power connectivity products. In addition, it provides magnetic solutions comprising integrated connector modules, power transformers, SMD power inductors and SMPS transformers, and discrete components-ethernet. The company sells its products through direct strategic account managers, regional sales managers working with independent sales representative organizations, and authorized distributors North America, Europe, Middle East, and Asia. Bel Fuse Inc. was incorporated in 1949 and is headquartered in West Orange, New Jersey.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"3677","sic_desc":"Electronic Coils, Transformers & Other Inductors","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","mcap":3581994496,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"WEST ORANGE, NJ","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"1231","cik":729580,"state_inc":"NJ","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-03"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"Yahoo quarterly income statement via yfinance (third-party fallback)","asof":"2026-09-29","q":[{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":null,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":null,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":null,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":null,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-06-30","rev":168299000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":2.03,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":26861000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":16.0,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-09-30","rev":178980000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":1.77,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":22250000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":12.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2025-12-31","rev":175938000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":-0.42,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":-5449000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":-3.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2026-03-31","rev":178491000.0,"rev_yoy":null,"eps":0.91,"eps_yoy":null,"ni":11379000.0,"ni_yoy":null,"nm":6.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2026-06-30","rev":210685000.0,"rev_yoy":25.2,"eps":1.89,"eps_yoy"